    "id": 805748,
    "name": "Dark Purple Iris Rhizome",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Plant Bulb just below the soil surface. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Bearded Iris (Iris germanica) are&nbsp;hardy perennials, prized for their complex, fragrant, six-petaled flowers (3 upright standards, 3 hanging falls) and a \"beard\" of tiny fuzz on the lower petals. They grow from thick, fleshy, drought-tolerant underground stems called&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=rhizomes&amp;newwindow=1&amp;sca_esv=9a3fab58edaf9218&amp;rlz=1CAVNCX_enUS1049US1049&amp;sxsrf=ANbL-n4JjJbTHWuiUiEqCLzOHs1ar2rwRA%3A1773682143284&amp;ei=3z24aef6EK7F0PEP2PrpgQM&amp;biw=1366&amp;bih=599&amp;ved=2ahUKEwiNjcX6-KSTAxWhCjQIHb4DOzkQgK4QegQIARAC&amp;uact=5&amp;oq=bearded+iris+rhizome+and+plant+description+for+a+store&amp;gs_&amp;sclient=gws-wiz-serp\" class=\"lexical-text-editor--link\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">rhizomes</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">. These easy-to-grow plants prefer full sun and well-drained soil, making them perfect for sunny garden beds.&nbsp;</span></p>",
